OL,3,GNEWSAResidents evacuated from homes
OL,4,Aduring security alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been evacuated from
OL,7,Ftheir homes during a security alert in
OL,8,FCounty Armagh.
OL,10,FA suspicious object is being examined
OL,11,Fin James Street in Lurgan.
OL,13,FThe street has been closed to traffic
OL,14,Fand pedestrians, police have said.
OL,16,FDemocratic Unionist Party councillor
OL,17,FPeter Haire said the council has opened
OL,18,FLurgan Town Hall for those affected.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
